FiLM-OSG reproducibility code

This repository contains reproducibility code for the FiLM-OSG manuscript.

DUE attribution
---------------

Portions of the local `film_osg` package are adapted from DUE:

    AI4Equations/DUE
    https://github.com/AI4Equations/due
    License: LGPL-2.1

The local copies are included to make the FiLM-OSG reproducibility scripts
runnable without requiring the external `due` package on the primary execution
path, while preserving compatibility with historical DUE-style APIs and model
files.

